WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.891
The live test stage deploys every
component to the test tenant,

2
00:00:03.891 --> 00:00:06.476
the test subscription and the test forest,

3
00:00:06.476 --> 00:00:10.538
in an order where nothing grants
access before it has been checked.

4
00:00:10.538 --> 00:00:13.374
First, baseline evidence, read only.

5
00:00:13.374 --> 00:00:17.675
Then the HR middleware, as a
dry run and then five records.

6
00:00:17.675 --> 00:00:21.875
Dynamic rules are created paused,
validated, then turned on.

7
00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:26.325
Lifecycle Workflows are created
disabled, with one on-demand run.

8
00:00:26.325 --> 00:00:29.710
Group Policy goes to a
test organizational unit,

9
00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.588
with an Intune dry run
and a cut-over drill.

10
00:00:32.588 --> 00:00:37.062
Machine configuration runs in audit
first, then apply and monitor.

11
00:00:37.062 --> 00:00:41.212
Ansible plans its wave and runs
in check mode before it connects.

12
00:00:41.212 --> 00:00:44.299
The drift pipeline's
first run is the baseline.

13
00:00:44.299 --> 00:00:46.653
And the stage ends with the smoke test,

14
00:00:46.653 --> 00:00:50.525
the evidence package, a rollback
drill and the evidence check.

15
00:00:50.525 --> 00:00:52.929
Every change is recorded as it's made:

16
00:00:52.929 --> 00:00:56.040
the rollback is only as
complete as the record.
